saying, "I hope that's lemonade"

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:11.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
to "I hope that's cider."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
Seriously, I love the fall
in New York City.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's nothing better tha
watching tourists

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:17.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
