[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:25.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
But everyone's
in the fall spirit.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
Some people spent the weeken
carving a pumpkin,

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
