is trying to impeach one.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:31.931 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:37.971 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:41.141
And Trump is still fuming
about the impeachment.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:44.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
And this weekend
he sent over 70 tweets.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:44.978 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
